      "raw": "[quote=\"josephamarino\"]\n\nI did a quick search, but I don&#39;t think I saw this question answered:Do the three targets for Tempest&#39;s Chain Lightning need to be different targets?&nbsp; Can I target a Villain three times with the card, or possibly target Villain-Minion-Villain?We played it as if the targets must be different, because it seemed a little too powerful, otherwise, but I figured I&#39;d ask for the real ruling.&nbsp;Thanks!\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nShort answer: Yes.\n\n&nbsp;Long answer: Yeeeeeeeeessssssssss.\n\nLong answer that isn&#39;t a tired joke: Chain lightning refers to a second target and a third target. These can&#39;t be the same target because then they&#39;d be the first target rather than the second (or third). This wording also applies to Bunker&#39;s Grenade Launcher.\n",
